rl":"https://github.com/Versent/saml2aws/blob/HEAD/LICENSE.md","packageLocalizations":{"en-US":{"description":"CLI tool which enables you to login and retrieve AWS temporary credentials using a SAML IDP","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/Versent/saml2aws/blob/HEAD/LICENSE.md","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"CLI tool which enables you to login and retrieve AWS temporary credentials using with ADFS or PingFederate Identity Providers.\nThis is based on python code from How to Implement a General Solution for Federated API/CLI Access Using SAML 2.0.\nThe process goes something like this:\n- Setup an account alias, either using the default or given a name\n- Prompt user for credentials\n- Log in to Identity Provider using form based authentication\n- Build a SAML assertion containing AWS roles\n- Optionally cache the SAML assertion (the cache is not encrypted)\n- Exchange the role and SAML assertion with AWS STS service to get a temporary set of credentials\n- Save these credentials to an aws profile named \"saml\"","name":"saml2aws","packageUrl":"https://github.com/Versent/saml2aws","publisher":"Versent","publisherUrl":"https://versent.com.au/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/Versent/saml2aws/releases/tag/v2.36.19","tags":[]},"zh-CN":{"description":"允许通过 SAML 身份提供商登录并获取 AWS 临时凭证的命令行工具","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"允许通过 ADFS 或 PingFederate 身份提供商登录并获取 AWS 临时凭证的命令行工具。\n该工具基于《How to Implement a General Solution for Federated API/CLI Access Using SAML 2.0（如何使用 SAML 2.0 实现联邦 API/CLI 访问的通用解决方案）》中的 Python 代码实现。\n流程如下：\n- 设置账户别名（使用默认名称或指定名称）\n- 提示用户输入凭据\n- 通过表单认证登录身份提供商\n- 构建包含 AWS 角色的 SAML 断言\n-（可选）缓存 SAML 断言（缓存未加密）\n- 将角色和 SAML 断言与 AWS STS 服务交换，获取临时凭证\n- 将这些凭证保存至名为“saml”的 AWS 配置文件中","tags":[]}},"publisherUrl":"https://versent.com.au/","releaseDate":"2025-03-13","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/Versent/saml2aws/releases/tag/v2.36.19","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847